{'symbol': 'PG', 'date': '2021-09-11 10:15:00', 'title': 'PROCTER & GAMBLE BRINGS RELIEF TO RESIDENTS AFFECTED BY HURRICANE IDA IN LOUISIANA WITH P&G PRODUCTS AND TIDE LOADS OF HOPE LAUNDRY SERVICES', 'text': '--(BUSINESS WIRE)--\xa0 WHO: FAMILIES, INDIVIDUALS AND FIRST RESPONDERS IN NEED OF PERSONAL CARE ITEMS, CLEANING PRODUCTS OR LAUNDRY SERVICES IN THE WAKE OF HURRICANE IDA IN LOUISIANA. WHAT: THE TIDE LOADS OF HOPE MOBILE LAUNDRY UNITS, POWERED BY MATTHEW 25: MINISTRIES, HAVE BEEN DEPLOYED TO SUPPORT RELIEF AND RECOVERY EFFORTS IN THE WAKE OF HURRICANE IDA THROUGHOUT LOUISIANA. THE MOBILE LAUNDRY VEHICLES WILL CONTINUE SERVICES IN LOUISIANA PROVIDING FREE, FULL-SERVICE LAUNDRY TO RESIDENTS AFFECTED'}